"description" = "Chess, but a little stranger.\n\nOddfish starts with serious Stockfish chess, then changes one rule at a time. RattleFish loses confidence when you play well. GluttonFish grows stronger when you feed it pieces. Restfish makes moved pieces take a nap. Twenty-nine modes across six families turn a familiar board into something wonderfully peculiar.\n\nMEET GIL\nA small gold fish with opinions explains every mode, reacts to the game, and reviews the aftermath.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n• Classic chess or 28 strange variations\n• Adjustable engine strength\n• Game history and PGN import\n• Optional move evaluation and hints\n• Carefully designed for iPhone and iPad\n\nSix modes—including Classic, RattleFish, FumbleFish, Restfish, GluttonFish, and ChapelFish—are free. A single Full Oddfish purchase unlocks every remaining mode. No subscription.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nEverything runs on your device. Oddfish has no accounts, ads, analytics, or tracking and does not collect personal data.\n\nStockfish plays the chess. Oddfish supplies the personality problem.";
